.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK LABEL CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik label create \- Create a project label (Organization administrators only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik label create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a project label (Organization administrators only)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --name
Label name (stored lowercase)
.TP
.B --color
Display color as a hex string
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
